    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Comfy Girl: Lofi Companion</strong>, you turn your home into a cozy retreat. Decorate it piece by piece with furniture, posters, and plants to build a peaceful space that feels just right for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/51e49c2d0fef38cfa4ddfdb94fbfa676.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.poster.avif?t=1755212515\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.webm?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.mp4?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're snuggling your pet, playing a quick mini-game, or just letting the lofi music play in the background, the experience is meant to fit naturally into your day. Let the chill lofi beats keep you company while the day rolls on around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/22101cbc5f45720e07a2704d3e068638.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/14b42d2928bd84f22f0cf3b75d9d50ec.avif?t=1755212515\" width=630 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfit to reflect how you're feeling. Maybe it's a cozy hoodie kind of day, or maybe you\u2019re in the mood for something soft and bright. Mix and match your favorite pieces, take your time, and create a look that feels just right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/aab3c531bfd9c862468f1694934d2247.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.poster.avif?t=1755212515\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.webm?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.mp4?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home with warm touches that feel just right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfit to match your mood, style, or the season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect adorable pet companions and unlock rare ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play optional mini-games and spend time with your grandma and best friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to chill lofi tracks that loop softly in the background as you go about your day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure. No timers. Just good vibes and a place to pause for a moment when you need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the creation of this game. Every line of code, art, and design was made thoughtfully by real people.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Comfy Girl: Lofi Companion</strong>, you turn your home into a cozy retreat. Decorate it piece by piece with furniture, posters, and plants to build a peaceful space that feels just right for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/51e49c2d0fef38cfa4ddfdb94fbfa676.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.poster.avif?t=1755212515\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.webm?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/b6c55441c9b19ef519d0795261894661.mp4?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're snuggling your pet, playing a quick mini-game, or just letting the lofi music play in the background, the experience is meant to fit naturally into your day. Let the chill lofi beats keep you company while the day rolls on around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/22101cbc5f45720e07a2704d3e068638.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/14b42d2928bd84f22f0cf3b75d9d50ec.avif?t=1755212515\" width=630 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfit to reflect how you're feeling. Maybe it's a cozy hoodie kind of day, or maybe you\u2019re in the mood for something soft and bright. Mix and match your favorite pieces, take your time, and create a look that feels just right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/aab3c531bfd9c862468f1694934d2247.avif?t=1755212515\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.poster.avif?t=1755212515\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.webm?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513000/extras/d8f06019ebc9474f626d428485c3ce37.mp4?t=1755212515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your home with warm touches that feel just right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your outfit to match your mood, style, or the season.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect adorable pet companions and unlock rare ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play optional mini-games and spend time with your grandma and best friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax to chill lofi tracks that loop softly in the background as you go about your day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pressure. No timers. Just good vibes and a place to pause for a moment when you need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the creation of this game. Every line of code, art, and design was made thoughtfully by real people.</p>",
    "short_description": "Need a cozy companion while you plan your day or just zone out? Comfy Girl: Lofi Companion lets you unlock and collect cute pets, decorate your virtual space, and relax with lofi music. Focus while you work or study, and enjoy time with Grandma and Zoe.",
